    0.13.0-dev - 2026/05/26 (71d0c81a) [develop]
        :brief 研究闭环监控：查新、PaperSpine、全局图与实时 Preview
        - feat(paper): 新增 NoveltyCheckpoint/PriorWorkMap/ExperimentNoveltyGate，按 literature、experiment_design、claim_ledger 阶段记录查新证据
        - feat(paper): 新增 ResearchWikiDigest、PaperSpine 和 GlobalFigureSpec artifact，补齐 idea archive、论文脊梁和期刊图示闭环
        - feat(orchestrator): 将查新 gate、实验转向 gate、PaperSpine 与 GlobalFigure 写入 PaperRun 事件与 artifact
        - feat(preview): 实时 Monitor 增加总览、查新、论文脊梁、全局图、草稿、账本和诊断页面
        - feat(tui): Paper 工作台右侧同步展示查新状态、spine readiness 和全局图 panel 数
        - docs(readme): 更新当前能力图、GitHub 仓库地址和实时监控说明
        - test(paper): 增加 research closure 单测、PaperRun 集成断言和 live preview browser smoke 报告
        :src
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/novelty.ts - 查新策略、prior work map、冲突分级与实验新颖性 gate
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/research-wiki.ts - idea archive/research wiki digest
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/paper-spine.ts - question、motivation、contribution、section intent、revision matrix
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/global-figure.ts - Nature/IEEE/ACM/generic figure profile 与 evidence-linked panel plan
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/orchestrator.ts - 阶段写入 closure artifacts 与事件
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/run.ts - PaperRun snapshot 与 preview monitor summary
        :preview
            - packages/preview/src/client.js - 只读实时 Monitor 渲染 stage、novelty、spine、figure、ledger、diagnostics
