        :tui
            - packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/routes/paper/index.tsx - 研究闭环侧栏展示
            - packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/routes/paper/workbench.ts - dashboard state 增加 research_closure
        :test
